Quiet Ceres still paid full weaponShips walks (_tickWeapons + NPC fire)
every tick while every non-player weapon ship slept with cold
cooldown/heat. Latch when typed projectile/vectorMine lanes are empty
and NPCs are idle; player tick/service stays live. Wake on membership,
live projectiles/mines, attack bag, beams, tactical-AI quiet clear, or
0.5 s rescan. Soft-GPU fps not claimed. Picture ON.

Different angle from held packCombat single-dirty / sampleProjectileEvidence
surface-cadence / preStep-all-sleeping / lifetimeSweep compact-skip.
---
